LanguageData.RUT_KyberFirstSaleText:
{0}

To the Empire, selling kyber crystal is about as illegal as anything gets. Every sale puts the clan's name a little higher on someone's list, and Imperial attention brings the hunt sooner and harder. The Hutts feel the opposite: a supplier with that much nerve is worth knowing.

The first sale can be denied. A second makes a pattern, and patterns get noticed by more than the Empire.

LanguageData.RUT_KyberVisitForthrightText:
{0}

True or not, it was an answer. The quiet one never spoke. The two who did thanked you and said, on the way out, that word travels: others are watching the same trades, and not all of them will ask so politely.

Whatever door that was, it is open now.
